{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>You shall slaughter.</b> Tenach has no cognate. The Gaon [Saadia] said: the cartilage attached to the circle of the ear." "<b>Upon them.</b> Many [read] bohanoṯ, and it is not on the standard [plural] pattern, and so there will be two patterns for one form, and many are like this among nouns." "And the second blood is dashed like the first blood — only the blood that remains."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:06.569013751Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}